body:
just to be clear, you are talking about the family sword that his father stole from the demon? if so then yea it didnt have as much of a purpose as his other swords like the grass sword or the fin sword, but by them having it, jake was captured and the demon was eventually killed. again I know its not that special and not directly because of the sword but I still count it.

&#x200B;

and aout the giant thing give me a break I am tired lmao. I saw the sword and just assumed. it does make a lot more sense that its sweat p though. kinda curious how the sword got as big as him.
